## 1. Owner entity class (with address field)

`/home/daniel/sandbox/src/main/java/org/springframework/samples/petclinic/model/Owner.java`

Extends `Person` (firstName/lastName live there). Relevant persisted fields:

```java
@Column(name = "address")
